Troubleshooting

Problem	Fix
Container shows Exit status	docker-compose logs service-name
Port not accessible in browser	Check EC2 Security Group — add inbound rule for that port
Permission denied on docker	Run: newgrp docker
Build fails	docker-compose build --no-cache
Stop all containers	docker-compose down
Restart one service	docker-compose restart service-name
See running containers	docker ps
Lost in folders	cd ~/submission to go back
